OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor suspended over conflict
OL,4,Aof interests
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn Ulster Unionist Party (UUP)
OL,7,Fcouncillor has been suspended for two
OL,8,Fmonths by a standards watchdog over
OL,9,Ffailing to register conflicts of
OL,10,Finterest related to his role as a
OL,11,FStormont adviser.
OL,13,FMark Ovens sits on Fermanagh and Omagh
OL,14,FDistrict Council and is also employed
OL,15,Fas a special adviser to Health Minister
OL,16,FRobbie Butler.
OL,18,FThe Northern Ireland Local Government
OL,19,FCommissioner for Standards Margaret
OL,20,FKelly said there had been a "conscious
OL,21,Fand ongoing disregard" of obligations
OL,22,Funder the councillors' code of conduct.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
FL,420,410,260,120,0,100
