OL,3,GNEWSACouncillor suspended over conflict
OL,4,Aof interests
OL,5,
OL,6,FOvens said his role at Stormont was
OL,7,F"openly known" and he regularly
OL,8,Fdeclared it but accepted he "should
OL,9,Fhave adopted an even more precautionary
OL,10,Fapproach".
